      "text": "The function \\( f \\) has derivatives of all orders, and its values at \\( x = 4 \\) are \\( f(4) = 2 \\), \\( f'(4) = \\frac{1}{4} \\), \\( f''(4) = -\\frac{1}{32} \\), \\( f'''(4) = \\frac{3}{256} \\). Let \\( P \\) be the second-degree Taylor polynomial for \\( f \\) about \\( x = 4 \\). Find the value of \\( P\\left(5\\right) \\)."
